,"path":"元.csv","pointer":8750,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"天香第一亭三首（汪叔志先茔在泾县方壶村墓亭有古桂延祐间汪擢乙科遂名亭天香第一） 其二","author":"宋褧","text":"世传佳木姓名偕，召伯甘棠王氏槐。\n记取汪坟苍桂树，文科应兆不相乖。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8751,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"天香第一亭三首（汪叔志先茔在泾县方壶村墓亭有古桂延祐间汪擢乙科遂名亭天香第一） 其三","author":"宋褧","text":"天上飘香云外过，青冥风露挹仙柯。\n文章自有流芳理，不用长安郭橐驼。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8752,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"月夜渡淮","author":"宋褧","text":"玉局翁赤壁岸，锦袍仙采石矶。\n千古词人高致，一般秋月清辉。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8753,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"陈南仲幼失母寻至永丰逆旅得见","author":"宋褧","text":"及泉忍闻誓母，历郡乃见寻亲。\n借问永丰逆旅，何如颖谷封人。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8754,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送校官萧性渊赴上丰城山市巡徼官二首（和林学正能鼓琴琴号霜钟） 其一","author":"宋褧","text":"儒冠暂易武弁，漠北径去江南。\n借问龙庭风雪，何如山市晴岚。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8755,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送校官萧性渊赴上丰城山市巡徼官二首（和林学正能鼓琴琴号霜钟） 其二","author":"宋褧","text":"绝句曾闻李涉，悲笳常爱刘琨。\n自鼓霜钟一操，群盗不怕櫜鞬。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8756,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"山行即事","author":"宋褧","text":"山云容易作雨，岩瀑取次成川。\n石润犹开水硙，林霏仅有炊烟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8757,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"调吴正传博士吴方为柳道传撰墓志","author":"宋褧","text":"词苑老臣遗世，成均故友知音。\n陈寿何尝得米，刘乂且欲分金。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8758,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"江叔志司业堪老园（四首） 其一","author":"宋褧","text":"先生尽会婆娑，文苑故老无多。\n去志任思泉石，归梦枉到松萝。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8759,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"江叔志司业堪老园（四首） 其二","author":"宋褧","text":"老子垂止足戒，将军存矍铄心。\n南山有三径菊，东都无二疏金。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8760,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"江叔志司业堪老园（四首） 其三","author":"宋褧","text":"故园之乐何如，大胜金马石渠。\n田头有秫酿酒，朝中无客通书。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8761,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"江叔志司业堪老园（四首） 其四","author":"宋褧","text":"老我菟裘何地，半世雨梗风萍。\n后日拿舟相访，还须许作园丁。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8762,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"满庭芳 汴中寒食","author":"宋褧","text":"雨意愔愔，养花天气，卖饧何处春箫。\n清明上巳，车马正连朝。\n对酒唱、归时多忘，惜花心、醉后偏饶。\n凝云暮，青楼帘捲，几度对魂销。\n无聊空怅望，东阑雪剩，北郭香飘。\n梦江南，行乐水远山遥。\n深院宇、绿窗啼鸟，明寒食、宝月良宵。\n秋千外，柳风柔小，无力著春娇。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8763,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}}]